   "subject": "output contents auto clear by any input change",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear All,<div><br></div><div>If I have several input selections with an action button, can i make the output contents auto cleared each time i made modifications on the input selection and then generate new output by clicking  the button.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you!</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
