  {
   "id": "iijRV9C6LGAJ",
   "from": "Amber James",
   "author": "e04bb64c7c0b4424",
   "date": "2015-07-13T06:17:41Z",
   "subject": "Re: output contents auto clear by any input change",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Please look into observeEvents these will help you greatly with situations like this. Here is a solution that fits what you are looking for. </div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ggplot2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  ui </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    textInput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;textT&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> label </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> h5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Title&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> value </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    textInput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;textX&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> label </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> h5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;X Axis Label&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> value </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    actionButton</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Btn&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;push me&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    plotOutput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;plot1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  server </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> output</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">    <br>  <br>   observe</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>      input$textT<br>      input$textX   <br>      output$plot1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">({})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>   observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input$Btn</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>     output$plot1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>        ggplot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mtcars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> gear</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> y</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> carb</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> geom_line</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ggtitle</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input$textT</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> xlab</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input$textX</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>   </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    <br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">})</span></code></div><div><br></div><div>Although I am unsure if the first observer event is proper coding style, it does work. Depending on your program you <i>should</i> be able to do something along these lines in a better manner. </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Hope this helps, </div><div><br></div><div>Amber James </div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "NsJkSDDCmlwJ",
   "from": "Joe Cheng",
   "author": "ca443e6eaa0e78ed",
   "date": "2015-07-13T18:54:38Z",
   "subject": "Re: output contents auto clear by any input change",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks for weighing in, Amber. I&#39;d tweak your example a bit to avoid defining output$plot1 inside of an observer (it&#39;s not a hard and fast rule, the way <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/iKwTnEsEACk/UEPPJWNjmuIJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/iKwTnEsEACk/UEPPJWNjmuIJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397828877000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-TmWKanj5rgI4q2xXGbb5\">avoiding defining outputs inside a reactive</a> is, but I personally prefer defining outputs once when possible):<div><br></div><div><div>library(shiny)</div><div>library(DT)</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>library(ggplot2)</div><div>shinyApp(</div><div>  ui = fluidPage(</div><div>    textInput(&quot;textT&quot;, label = h5(&quot;Title&quot;), value = &quot;&quot;),</div><div>    textInput(&quot;textX&quot;, label = h5(&quot;X Axis Label&quot;), value = &quot;&quot;),</div><div>    actionButton(&quot;Btn&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;push me&quot;),</div><div>    plotOutput(&#39;plot1&#39;)),</div><div>  server = function(input, output) {    </div><div>    </div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>    v &lt;- reactiveValues(clearPlot = TRUE)</div><div>    </div><div>    output$plot1 = renderPlot({</div><div>      if (v$clearPlot)</div><div>        return()</div><div>      else</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>        ggplot(mtcars, aes(x= gear, y= carb)) + geom_line() +ggtitle(input$textT) + xlab(input$textX)</div><div>    })</div><div>    </div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>    observeEvent(c(input$textT, input$textX), {</div><div>      v$clearPlot &lt;- TRUE</div><div>    }, priority = 10)</div><div>    observeEvent(input$Btn, {</div><div>      v$clearPlot &lt;- FALSE</div><div>    }, priority = 10)</div><div>    </div><div>  }</div><div>)</div></div><div><br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Sun, Jul 12, 2015 at 11:17 PM Amber James &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">amber....@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Please look into observeEvents these will help you greatly with situations like this. Here is a solution that fits what you are looking for. </div><div><br></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span></code></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ggplot2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  ui </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    textInput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;textT&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> label </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> h5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Title&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> value </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    textInput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;textX&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> label </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> h5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;X Axis Label&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> value </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    actionButton</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Btn&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;push me&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    plotOutput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;plot1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  server </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> output</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">    <br>  <br>   observe</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>      input$textT<br>      input$textX   <br>      output$plot1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">({})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>   observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input$Btn</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>     output$plot1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>        ggplot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mtcars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> gear</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> y</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> carb</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> geom_line</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ggtitle</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input$textT</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> xlab</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input$textX</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>   </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    <br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">})</span></code></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div>Although I am unsure if the first observer event is proper coding style, it does work. Depending on your program you <i>should</i> be able to do something along these lines in a better manner. </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Hope this helps, </div><div><br></div><div>Amber James </div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div></div>"
